---

<footer class="bg-primary text-white/80 mt-16">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-8">
    <div
      class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-start md:justify-between gap-6"
    >
      <div>
        <a href="/" class="text-white hover:text-accent">
          <span class="text-lg font-bold font-heading">rep.et</span>
        </a>
        <p class="text-sm mt-1 text-white/50">Find your representative</p>
      </div>

      <nav class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-2 text-sm">
        <a href="/representatives" class="text-white/70 hover:text-white"
          >Representatives</a
        >
        <a href="/regions" class="text-white/70 hover:text-white">Regions</a>
        <a href="/parties" class="text-white/70 hover:text-white">Parties</a>
        <a href="/map" class="text-white/70 hover:text-white">Map</a>
        <a href="/stats" class="text-white/70 hover:text-white">Stats</a>
        <a href="/about" class="text-white/70 hover:text-white">About</a>
      </nav>
    </div>

    <div
      class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-white/10 text-xs text-white/50 leading-relaxed space-y-2"
    >
      <p>
        The code and data for this website are publicly available and open
        source on <a
          href="https://github.com/frectonz/rep.et"
          class="text-white/70 hover:text-white underline">GitHub</a
        >.
      </p>
      <p>
        This is an independent, unofficial project. It is not affiliated with or
        endorsed by the Ethiopian government, <a
          href="https://nebe.org.et/"
          class="text-white/70 hover:text-white underline"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer">NEBE</a
        >, or any political party. Data collected from the 6th National Election
        results published by the <a
          href="https://nebe.org.et/"
          class="text-white/70 hover:text-white underline"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >National Election Board of Ethiopia (NEBE)</a
        >.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you find any inaccuracies or want to contact the creators of this
        site, reach out to <a
          href="https://t.me/frectonz"
          class="text-white/70 hover:text-white underline">@frectonz</a
        > on Telegram.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-white/10">
      <h4
        class="text-white/70 text-xs font-semibold mb-3 uppercase tracking-wider"
      >
        Sister projects
      </h4>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 sm:flex sm:flex-wrap">
        <a
          href="https://electionwatch.et"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="flex flex-col leading-tight rounded-lg px-5 py-3 sm:min-w-[220px] transition-opacity hover:opacity-80"
          style="background-color:#1f2455"
        >
          <span class="text-lg font-bold font-heading text-white"
            >electionwatch.et</span
          >
          <span class="text-white/60 text-xs -mt-0.5">ምርጫ</span>
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://audit.et"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="flex flex-col leading-tight rounded-lg px-5 py-3 sm:min-w-[220px] transition-opacity hover:opacity-80"
          style="background-color:#1b3b34"
        >
          <span class="text-lg font-bold font-heading text-white">audit.et</span
          >
          <span class="text-white/60 text-xs -mt-0.5">ኦዲት</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
